WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.360
On Zion’s Canyon Overlook Trail,
rock hides most of the view.

00:04.980 --> 00:08.120
A gap opens toward the West Temple,
then closes again.

00:10.720 --> 00:13.140
At the overlook,
the canyon opens below.

00:13.740 --> 00:15.460
In this bare-earth model,

00:15.460 --> 00:17.680
nearly half the ground
visible along the trail

00:17.680 --> 00:20.140
first appears
in the final fifteen meters.
